      },
      "language": "cpp",
      "engine": "engine.rust.advanced",
      "title": "搜索插入位置：缩小半开区间",
      "topic": "二分边界与不变量",
      "source": {
        "provider": "LeetCode",
        "problemNumber": 35,
        "title": "Search Insert Position",
        "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/search-insert-position/description/",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-01",
        "termsUrl": "https://leetcode.com/terms/",
        "authorization": "not-confirmed",
        "use": "原始题号/链接与必要事实；本站中文概括、讲解、代码及示例独立编写，不导入题解或整段原文。"
      },
      "originalConstraints": "原题长度1～10⁴，元素与target均为−10⁴～10⁴；数组严格升序且元素互异，要求O(log n)时间。找到时返回原位置，否则返回保持有序的插入位置。",
      "statement": "给定严格递增的整数数组，找到第一个不小于目标的位置。如果目标比所有元素都大，位置就是数组长度。这个位置既能表示命中，也能表示插入。",
      "platformConstraints": "本页长度1～12，整数和目标均为−999～999；输入必须严格递增且互异，乱序或重复不会被静默排序。输出一个0基位置，范围0～n。",
      "minItems": 1,
      "maxItems": 12,
      "min": -999,
      "max": 999,
      "hasTarget": true,
      "strictlyIncreasing": true,
      "prerequisiteLessonRef": {
        "id": "lesson.c.binary-search-first",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      },
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        {
          "id": "knowledge.c.binary-search",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        },
        {
          "id": "knowledge.c.arrays",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        },
        {
          "id": "knowledge.c.conditions",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        },
        {
          "id": "knowledge.c.loops",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      ],
      "strategy": "半开区间二分",
      "explanation": [
        "初始候选区间为[left,right)=[0,n)。left之前的元素都小于target；right及之后的位置已无需继续检查。",
        "取mid=left+(right-left)/2。values[mid]<target时令left=mid+1；否则令right=mid。两条路径都严格缩短区间，也不会访问values[n]。",
        "当left==right时，候选区间为空，边界就是答案。对[-5,0,7,11]、target=3，边界停在2；目标大于全部元素时停在4。"
      ],
      "complexity": "二分搜索核心O(log n)；含输入读取的完整演示O(n)，额外空间O(1)。",
      "derivation": "每轮将候选区间缩小到原来约一半，经过对数轮后长度为0。只保存left/right/mid/target等标量；读取输入与打印不计入二分核心的搜索复杂度。",
      "pitfalls": [
        "right可以等于n，但只有mid会被用来读取数组，且始终小于right。",
        "本例要求互异严格升序；输入重复时不把一般lower_bound扩展冒称为本例完整原题条件。"
      ],
      "reviewQuestion": "为什么用right=mid，而不是mid−1，仍能保证循环结束？",
      "sourceFile": "content/advanced/example-search-insert-1.0.0.cpp",
      "defaults": {
        "values": [-5, 0, 7, 11],
        "target": 3
      },
      "samples": [
        {
          "key": "middle-gap",
          "values": [-5, 0, 7, 11],
          "target": 3,
          "expectedStdout": "2\n",
          "expectedReturn": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "hit",
          "values": [-5, 0, 7, 11],
          "target": 7,
          "expectedStdout": "2\n",
          "expectedReturn": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "before-first",
          "values": [-5, 0, 7, 11],
          "target": -8,
          "expectedStdout": "0\n",
          "expectedReturn": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "after-last",
          "values": [-5, 0, 7, 11],
          "target": 20,
          "expectedStdout": "4\n",
          "expectedReturn": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "single",
          "values": [3],
          "target": 4,
          "expectedStdout": "1\n",
          "expectedReturn": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "max-length",
          "values": [-999, -100, -50, -20, -5, 0, 3, 8, 20, 50, 100, 999],
          "target": 999,
          "expectedStdout": "11\n",
          "expectedReturn": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
